step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Trufitus</col> in his house located north-east of <col=800000>Tai Bwo Wannai</col>. Everytime you gather a new herb you need to go show it to <col=800000>Trufitus</col> before being able to get a new kind of a herb.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Trufitus in his house located north-east of Tai Bwo Wannai. Everytime you gather a new herb you need to go show it to Trufitus before being able to get a new kind of a herb.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go south-west of Tai Bwo Wannai until green and yellow vines labelled '<col=800000>marshy jungle vine</col>' are seen.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Trufitus in his house located north-east of Tai Bwo Wannai. Everytime you gather a new herb you need to go show it to Trufitus before being able to get a new kind of a herb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-west of Tai Bwo Wannai until green and yellow vines labelled 'marshy jungle vine' are seen.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Search the vines and clean the herb. Your character may spend several minutes finding a herb.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Trufitus in his house located north-east of Tai Bwo Wannai. Everytime you gather a new herb you need to go show it to Trufitus before being able to get a new kind of a herb.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-west of Tai Bwo Wannai until green and yellow vines labelled 'marshy jungle vine' are seen.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the vines and clean the herb. Your character may spend several minutes finding a herb.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Trufitus. Make sure you cleaned the herb.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Trufitus in his house located north-east of Tai Bwo Wannai. Everytime you gather a new herb you need to go show it to Trufitus before being able to get a new kind of a herb.</str>
