line	
line	<col=000080>In the cave, head south, look for green spots on the wall labelled '<col=800000>Fungus covered Cavern wall</col>', then search them and clean the herb. This process may take up to a minute. Do not try to use a Rogue's purse dropped by a Jogre. It must be obtained via searching the wall.</col>
